    "changelog": "## What's New in v6.3.2\n\n### Fixed\n- Bulk processing: the automatic global species merge after AED and clustering no longer fails with \"mixed dimensionality\". Recordings clustered after switching the feature type to Perch are now merged; older ones are skipped with a note instead of failing the whole site.\n- The new clustering methods now save proper cluster centres, so their results take part in the site merge.\n- Cluster snapshot saving no longer errors on every recording.\n\n### Improved\n- First launch asks for your email; you can change it in Profile. Member Since and Last Login show real dates.\n- Job Stats has its own Project and Site pickers. The Incremental Clustering tab was removed.",
